 mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 57pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 57pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: 57pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">MERS</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">의 영향으로 대학 또는 초</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">중</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">고 등